@startuml activity-seed-and-consume
' Spec 002 — launch regions are seeded (REQ-002-5); other features consume active regions (REQ-002-6)
title Seed launch regions and consume the list (REQ-002-5/6)

start
:Operator runs seeds (fresh install
or again later);
repeat
  :Next launch region
  (Davao City, Cebu, Metro Manila);
  if (Region with this slug exists?) then (yes)
    :Skip — keep admin's edits;
  else (no)
    :Insert as active;
  endif
repeat while (More launch regions?) is (yes)
->no;
:Seed done;

:A consuming feature (003 / 005 / 010)
asks for regions to offer users;
:Receive active regions only, A→Z;
:Look up a region by slug
(from a URL or a listing);
if (Found?) then (yes)
  :Use it — even if hidden
  (old links keep resolving);
else (no)
  :Not found;
endif
stop
@enduml
